31	   * "+30 days" beside the plan's MONTHLY price, while `renewNow` has always
32	   * charged a full term. "Renew now (+30 days, $8.99)" took **$97.09** and moved
33	   * the expiry twelve months — 10.8× on Starter/12mo, 28.8× on Max/36mo, with no
34	   * confirmation between the click and the debit. Never re-derive these two
